MM>match (including 'text a' AND 'text b' etc.). I'd like to be able to
MM>then start up word to view the files with matches (in an ideal world I
MM>could start it up to go directly to the match string). I'd rather not
MM>have to write an OPL viewer, as this would be re-inventing the wheel,
MM>and take a lot of time as well. Am I being being too hopeful???

